# The beach: east along the south road from town. Dune grass and palms under the tree line, the beach shack
# (its tide board says what's biting), tide pools in the rocks, wet sand, and a pier out into the sea.
# Shells, coral, sea glass and driftwood wash up each morning on a few spots (beach.c); fish off the shore or the pier.
